        "pwm_output",
        "led_high"
      ],
      "notes": "PIN_LED / LED_BUILTIN (schematic ref D1, \"Signalling LED\") - onboard LED switched by Q1 (AO3400A N-channel MOSFET) with gate driven by GPIO6/D13_SCK; GPIO HIGH turns Q1 on and lights the LED, confirmed active-high from the schematic. Also aliased as PIN_SPI0_SCK (D13) - a deliberate, expected dual-role matching every classic Arduino Uno/Nano-form-factor board's pin-13 LED+SCK sharing, not a bug; spi_sck capability is auto-supplied by build_boards.js on top of these."
